OL,4,BMillwall face partial stadium closure  
OL,5,Bover chants                            
OL,6,GMillwall have been ordered to play a   
OL,7,Gfuture Championship match in front of  
OL,8,Ga partially-closed stadium as          
OL,9,Gpunishment for fans' discriminatory    
OL,10,Gchants.                                
OL,12,FThe club has also been fined #70,000   
OL,13,Fby an independent regulatory           
OL,14,Fcommission, and been told another      
OL,15,Foffence this season will lead to a     
OL,16,Ffurther partial stadium closure.       
OL,18,FThe sanctions were imposed for ableist 
OL,19,Fand homophobic chants, heard at a game 
OL,20,Fagainst Charlton Athletic in January.  
